WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.534
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:04.000
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.400
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.601
CNN has reported that a lawyer

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.534
for former vice president
Mike Pence

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:12.467
found a dozen
classified documents last week

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.100
at Pence's Indiana home.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.200
Okay, so they're just
in every home?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.601
That's the only thing
that makes sense anymore.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:23.467
When you buy a new house
and you move in,

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:26.834
there's just classified
documents sitting on the counter

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:31.434
next to that half roll of paper
towels and box of baking soda.

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:34.567
President Biden is expected to
spend the weekend at Camp David,

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.267
and you know
it's been a rough week

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:39.734
when you start making
your weekend plans on Tuesday.

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:41.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.934
The Justice Department
is reportedly considering plans

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.567
to search other locations
connected to President Biden

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:47.767
as part of its investigation

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.634
into his handling
of classified documents,

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:53.400
which could include everywhere
from Cold Stone to TCBY.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:58.434
According to a new poll,
nearly 60% of New York voters

00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:01.133
think Republican congressman
George Santos should resign,

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:05.701
while according to him,
180% say he shouldn't.

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:07.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.634
That's his poll.
That's his internal polling.

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:11.834
A newly surfaced video

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:14.434
appears to show New York
congressman George Santos

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.701
saying that he survived
an assassination attempt.

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:17.968
I guess we can't be surprised.

00:01:17.968 --> 00:01:20.334
There's always someone
gunning for you

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:22.367
when you're the star
of the volleyball team

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:23.968
at Baruch College.

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:27.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.334
Former FBI official
Charles McGonigal

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:31.968
was arrested over the weekend
on charges of money laundering

00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:34.033
and violating sanctions
against Russia

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:35.834
while working with
a Russian oligarch.

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:38.801
But remember, under our system,
McGonigal is innocent

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:41.300
until Trump calls him
a good man.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:45.801
A South Carolina woman
recently used winnings

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.501
from a scratch-off
lottery ticket

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:51.767
to purchase a Powerball ticket
and won $150,000

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:53.901
in what financial experts
are calling

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:57.167
still a smarter investment
strategy than crypto.

00:01:57.167 --> 00:01:59.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.200
Candy company Mars
announced yesterday

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.901
it will replace its
so-called M&amp;M's spokescandies

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:05.067
in upcoming ads.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:07.968
Luckily, the green one's
got another gig lined up.

00:02:07.968 --> 00:02:10.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:15.133
"You melted
in my husband's hands."

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:16.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:23.400
Authorities in Spain recently
raided a tobacco factory

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.300
accused of exploiting workers

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:28.234
and seized $41 million worth
of leaves and cigarettes.

00:02:28.234 --> 00:02:29.634
And to teach them a lesson,

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:33.234
they're going to make them
smoke every last one of them.

00:02:33.234 --> 00:02:35.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:43.667
I should make whoever wrote that
smoke the joke.

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:45.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:50.100
Roll it up.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.267
And finally --
Oh, it's Scollins.

00:02:52.267 --> 00:02:55.167
Thank you. Wally went back
to let me know who wrote it.

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:57.767
He wanted to make sure
I could shame him by name.

00:02:57.767 --> 00:02:59.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:01.601
Mike Scollins.

00:03:01.601 --> 00:03:06.267
If you're watching,
which you probably aren't,

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:08.167
go smoke your joke.

00:03:08.167 --> 00:03:10.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:13.634
And finally, after
Disney World's Splash Mountain

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:15.133
officially closed yesterday,

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:18.133
containers of water from
the ride are being sold on eBay,

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:21.467
including one listing
for a four-ounce bottle for $4,

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:24.801
which is still way cheaper than
buying a water at Disney World.

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:26.968
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:26.968 --> 00:03:27.968
We're off and running.

